<section
  class="home-questions wrap"
  id="questions"
  aria-labelledby="questions-title"
>
  <div>
    <p class="kicker">Before we start</p>
    <h2 id="questions-title">A few practical questions.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="home-question-list">
    <details>
      <summary
        >Do we need a finished specification?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span
        ></summary
      >
      <p>
        A description of the problem is enough for the first conversation. The
        paid first phase is where we examine the work with your team and define
        the result. If you already have a clear target, we start there.
      </p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary
        >Will our team need to adopt Festival?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span
        ></summary
      >
      <p>
        We use Festival to organize our delivery. The engagement is built around
        your existing environment and workflow; operating Festival is not a
        requirement for your team.
      </p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary
        >How are scope and price agreed?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span
        ></summary
      >
      <p>
        We agree the scope and price in writing before work starts. The first
        phase is paid and has a defined checkpoint, so you can decide whether to
        continue based on what we find.
      </p>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>
